# Cloudflare Pages Configuration Reference
# This file is for documentation only - configure these in Cloudflare Pages dashboard

## Build Settings
Build command: bun install && cd apps/frontend && bun run build
Build output directory: apps/frontend/dist
Root directory: (empty - use repository root)

## Environment Variables
BUN_VERSION=latest

## Notes
- Cloudflare Pages auto-detects Bun if BUN_VERSION is set
- The monorepo structure requires installing from root
- workspace:* protocol is supported by Bun
- SSR is handled by the Cloudflare Pages adapter automatically
